Resolve two candidate interpretations of one route-planning instruction. The instruction is the sole authority. Candidate agreement is not proof of correctness.

Return one JSON object only:
{"intent":{"pois":[],"time_limit":null,"dependencies":[],"quality_weight":0.5},"evidence":{},"changes":[]}

Evidence must quote short spans from the instruction. Changes must name every candidate field you revised. Do not use route efficiency to infer what the user wants.

Instruction:
Your itinerary today includes visiting the pharmacy, the shopping mall, the library, and the bank. Remember to stop at the library before heading to the bank. All visits must be completed with return by 17:00. Keep the travel distance minimal and direct.

